  "applies_to": "Badger Meter / Data Industrial 340 BN/MB Btu energy transmitters with one pulse or sine flow sensor and two temperature sensors.",
  "summary": "The 340 BN/MB computes hydronic thermal energy from a flow sensor and supply/return temperature sensors. Its RS-485 port runs Modbus or BACnet MS/TP (slave). The BACnet map has five analog inputs (both temperatures, input frequency, flow rate, energy rate) and 17 analog values for the flow and energy totals plus the calibration and filter settings.",
