    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": "Rev 1.00 (PICS)",
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "The manual prints the analog input IDs as AN1-AN5; they are shown here as AI 1-5.",
    "The BACnet map has no read/write column; all objects are shown as read-only. The matching Modbus registers are all marked read-only.",
    "Units follow the units chosen when the transmitter is programmed; the map lists the possible units.",
    "The device is an MS/TP slave, so it does not pass the token.",
    "Source: Table 2 'BACnet object map', page 22 (22 objects)."
  ],
